  "description": "Click here and download the Knitted Christmas Stocking STL Set · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Create a warm and cozy holiday display with this beautiful Knitted Christmas Stocking STL Set, featuring 3 unique stocking designs with detailed cable-knit, braided yarn, and ribbed textile-inspired patterns.\n\nEach stocking has its own decorative character. The first features a rich chunky cable-knit pattern, the second uses elegant vertical ribbing with a delicate bow and hanging pom-poms, while the third combines braided cables with a charming hanging star accent. All three include a practical top loop, making the designs perfect for Christmas ornament-style displays.\n\nThe realistic knitted detailing gives these models the appearance of handmade wool stockings while maintaining solid sculptural forms suitable for 3D printing. They are ideal for Christmas tree decorations, mantel displays, holiday garlands, winter décor, gift decorations, and festive home displays.\n\nThe models can be colored using Bambu Studio, PrusaSlicer, Cura, OrcaSlicer, or other compatible slicer software, allowing you to customize the stockings, cuffs, bows, pom-poms, stars, loops, and other details with your preferred colors.\n\nIncluded: 3 decorative knitted-style Christmas Stocking models.\n\nDigital Product: STL files for 3D printing only. No physical stockings, ribbons, branches, lights, or photography props are included.",
